Z||000071||grgoyl86||05-15-2001||01:51 PM||||Wow! This should be a great show! We should have well over 100 Fieros there!<BR>We're almost ready.<BR>Just as a reminder, the Carlisle Import-Kit/Replicar Nationals will be going on all weekend, and Fieros At Carlisle will be on Saturday. Check out <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com</A>  for more info, or contact me at bobschlag@fieropride.com.<BR>For Fierodave2001, from FL, the easiest way to get there is I-95 to Baltimore, then I-83N past York, PA, to I-76 (PA Turnpike) west. Follow that to the Carlisle exit. Go to US11 west. You should see signs for the Carlisle Fairgrounds at the turnpike exit. Follow them.<BR>There are slightly shorter ways, but this is the easiest.<P>Looking forward to seeing all of you there!<P>Bob||||reg||6
