Z||000073||Chris Schaefer||05-15-2001||09:44 PM||||Every year I want to go but every year there is something happening that keeps me from going.  Usually, I have my car apart from March until July.<P>This year my car is still in one piece but I still can't go.  On May 5th of this year my wife delivered our first child.  As young as our new daughter is I wouldn't feel right going and leaving my wife home alone.<P>So my first Fiero show will be in Old Orchard Beach, ME June 15-16 and my second will be Williamsburg, VA August 2-5.  I will be sure to squeak one more one September 23 in Rutland, MA.  <P>I wish I could go to all the shows but I am not retired so most of my time is devoted to working.<P>Everyone please have some fun at Carlisle for me.<P>Thanks.||||reg||10
